<title>SPAIN: Viscofan 9-mth profits rise to 940 mln ptas.</title>
<headline>Viscofan 9-mth profits rise to 940 mln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Viscofan in millions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Gp Pretax profit/loss			 820   vs 330</p>
<p> Gp Net profit				   939   vs 392</p>
<p> Gp Turnover				  36,838   vs 34,108</p>
<p> Parent pretax				 1,305   vs 1,297</p>
<p> Parent net				    1,305   vs 1,297</p>
<p> Parent turnover			     9,685   vs 7,634</p>
</text>
